      <div>
         <p class="c25"><span class="c16">RATING AGREEMENT FOR ASSIGNEE PAYOUT</span></p>
      </div>
      <p class="c9" id="h.gjdgxs"><span class="c13">RATING AGREEMENT</span></p>
      <p class="c1"><span class="c13"></span></p>
      <p class="c8"><span class="c13">Ref No: </span></p>
      <p class="c1"><span class="c2"></span></p>
      <p class="c8"><span class="c2">Date: {!DAY(TODAY())}/{!MONTH(TODAY())}/{!YEAR(TODAY())}</span></p>
      <p class="c1"><span class="c2"></span></p>
      <p class="c8"><span class="c18">Mr. </span><span class="c20">{!Opportunity.Contact_for_MPRA_SOW__r.Name}</span></p>
      <p class="c8"><span class="c2">{!Opportunity.Account.Name}</span></p>
      <p class="c8"><span class="c2">{!Opportunity.BillingAddress__r.Billing_Street__c+' , '+Opportunity.BillingAddress__r.Billing_City__c+' , '+Opportunity.BillingAddress__r.BillingState__c+' , '+Opportunity.BillingAddress__r.Billing_Zip_Postal_Code__c+' , '+Opportunity.BillingAddress__r.BillingCountry__c}</span></p>
      <p class="c1"><span class="c2"></span></p>
      <p class="c8"><span class="c18">Dear</span><span class="c20">&nbsp;{!Opportunity.Contact_for_MPRA_SOW__r.Name},</span></p>
      <p class="c1"><span class="c2"></span></p>
      <p class="c8"><span class="c20">Please refer your request to ICRA Limited (ICRA) seeking a rating on Assignee Payout for retail loan pool of {!Opportunity.CurrencyDisplayFormula__c} {!Opportunity.VoD_in_crore__c} {!Opportunity.Crore_or_Million__c}  </span><span class="c20 c47">(hereinafter referred to as the &ldquo;</span><span class="c18 c47">Security</span><span class="c20 c47">&rdquo;)</span><span class="c2">&nbsp;(principal outstanding as on cut-off date) originated by
{!Opportunity.Account.Name} (hereinafter referred to as &ldquo;your Company&rdquo; or &ldquo;you&rdquo; or &ldquo;your&rdquo;).</span></p>
      <p class="c1"><span class="c13"></span></p>
      <p class="c8"><span class="c20">ICRA is pleased to take up your mandate and looks forward to carrying out the assignment once it has received your acceptance of the terms of this Agreement as enumerated below. &ldquo;</span><span class="c18">ICRA</span><span class="c20">&rdquo;, &ldquo;</span><span class="c18">we</span><span class="c20">&rdquo;, &ldquo;</span><span class="c18">our</span><span class="c20">&rdquo; and &ldquo;</span><span class="c18">us</span><span class="c2">&rdquo; refer to ICRA Limited and all directors, officers and employees of ICRA Limited.</span></p>
      <p class="c9 c30"><span class="c2"></span></p>
      <p class="c8"><span class="c13">TERMS OF RATING AGREEMENT</span></p>
      <p class="c1"><span class="c13"></span></p>
      <ol class="c5 lst-kix_list_1-0 start" start="1">
         <li class="c3"><span class="c13">Definitions</span></li>
      </ol>
      <p class="c1"><span class="c13"></span></p>
      <ol class="c5 lst-kix_list_25-0 start" start="1">
         <li class="c8 c19 li-bullet-0"><span class="c20">&ldquo;</span><span class="c18">Agreement</span><span class="c20">&rdquo; refers to these written terms and conditions of this agreement, rating requisition form, and all schedules and annexures, each as may be amended, supplemented or modified from time to time or at any time as per directive(s) issued by Securities Exchange Board of India (&ldquo;</span><span class="c18">SEBI</span><span class="c2">&rdquo;).</span></li>
      </ol>
      <p class="c1 c17"><span class="c2"></span></p>
      <ol class="c5 lst-kix_list_25-0" start="2">
         <li class="c8 c19 li-bullet-0"><span class="c20">&ldquo;</span><span class="c18">Credit Rating</span><span class="c20">&rdquo; or &ldquo;</span><span class="c18">Rating</span><span class="c20">&rdquo; refers to an opinion regarding the securities under the Transaction (</span><span class="c20 c23">defined below</span><span class="c20">), expressed in the form of standard symbols or in any other standardized manner, assigned by ICRA and used by the issuer of such securities, to comply with a requirement specified by SEBI (Credit Rating Agencies) Regulations, 1999 and corresponding guidelines and circulars as may be issued by SEBI from time to time (&ldquo;</span><span class="c18">Regulations</span><span class="c20">&rdquo;). ICRA&rsquo;s credit ratings do not address any other risk, including liquidity risk, market value risk, or price volatility. Any rating must be construed solely as a statement of opinion and not a statement of fact. A Credit Rating is not an offer, invitation, inducement or recommendation to purchase, sell or hold any securities or otherwise act in relation to any issue, the relevant issuer (each an &ldquo;</span><span class="c18">Issuer</span><span class="c20">&rdquo;) or the relevant transaction (each, a &ldquo;</span><span class="c18">Transaction</span><span class="c20">&rdquo;) to which this Agreement relates or otherwise in connection with any associated transaction, entity, or matter. References in this Agreement to &ldquo;rating&rdquo; or &ldquo;credit rating&rdquo; also encompass any revalidation of the Rating and the terms of this Agreement will apply to any such revalidation of the Rating.</span></li>
      </ol>
      <p class="c9 c17 c30"><span class="c29 c18"></span></p>
      <ol class="c5 lst-kix_list_25-0" start="3">
         <li class="c8 c19 li-bullet-0"><span class="c20">&ldquo;</span><span class="c18">Rating Fee</span><span class="c20">&rdquo; refers to the non-refundable initial fee payable in advance by your Company to ICRA in consideration for the Rating to be assigned by ICRA to the Security and shall be exclusive of the applicable tax payable thereon. </span></li>
      </ol>
      <p class="c9 c17 c30"><span class="c2"></span></p>
      <ol class="c5 lst-kix_list_25-0" start="4">
         <li class="c8 c19 li-bullet-0"><span class="c20">&ldquo;</span><span class="c18">Surveillance Fee</span><span class="c20">&rdquo; refers to the fee for the continuous monitoring of the Rating by ICRA from the date of assignment of initial Rating during the term of the Rating.</span></li>
      </ol>
      <p class="c9 c17 c30"><span class="c13"></span></p>
      <ol class="c5 lst-kix_list_25-0" start="5">
         <li class="c8 c19 li-bullet-0"><span class="c20 c41">&ldquo;</span><span class="c15">Unpublished Price Sensitive Information&nbsp;(&ldquo;UPSI&rdquo;)&rdquo;</span><span class="c20 c41">&nbsp;means any information, relating to your Company or your securities, directly or indirectly, that is not generally available and which upon becoming generally available, is likely to materially affect the price of the securities and shall, ordinarily include but not restricted to, information relating to the financial results, dividends, change in capital structure, mergers, de-mergers, acquisitions, de-listings, disposals and expansion of business and such other transactions, and changes in key managerial personnel and/or any other information which is accompanied by a written notice specifying that such information is an UPSI.</span></li>
      </ol>
      <p class="c1 c17"><span class="c13"></span></p>
      <ol class="c5 lst-kix_list_1-0" start="2">
         <li class="c3"><span class="c13">Scope of work and Rating Fee</span></li>
      </ol>
      <p class="c1 c17"><span class="c29 c18"></span></p>
      <ol class="c5 lst-kix_list_23-0 start" start="1">
         <li class="c8 c19 li-bullet-0"><span class="c20">ICRA shall, after due consideration, assign a Rating (accompanied, if necessary, by an outlook and/or other indicators) to the said Security of your Company. </span></li>
      </ol>
      <p class="c1 c17"><span class="c29 c18"></span></p>
      <ol class="c5 lst-kix_list_23-0" start="2">
         <li class="c8 c19 li-bullet-0"><span class="c2">Upon acceptance of the Rating or notification of use of the Rating by your Company to ICRA in the manner set out in clause D (I) below and subject to clause F of this Agreement, ICRA shall keep the Rating under surveillance during the lifetime of the Security. The Company shall co-operate with ICRA to enable the later to carry out periodic review of the rating during the tenure of the Rating.</span></li>
      </ol>
      <p class="c1"><span class="c13"></span></p>
      <ol class="c5 lst-kix_list_23-0" start="3">
         <li class="c8 c19 li-bullet-0" id="h.30j0zll"><span class="c20">The Rating fee payable by your Company to ICRA is Rs. [&#9679;] plus applicable GST and/or any other applicable taxes. The Surveillance Fee from the second year onwards will be Rs. [&#9679;], plus applicable GST and/or any other applicable taxes, and shall be payable each year</span><span class="c20 c60">&nbsp;</span><span class="c2">during the term of the Rating. It is hereby clarified that notwithstanding your non-acceptance of the Rating or failure to notify ICRA of your acceptance/non-acceptance of the Rating, any use of the Rating by your Company, in any manner whatsoever, shall obligate your Company to pay the Surveillance Fee after ICRA becomes aware of the use of the Rating. Your Company shall also reimburse ICRA all travel and out-of-pocket expenses that it incurs in connection with the Rating process, both payable initially and during surveillance. Rating Fee/Surveillance Fee shall be paid by your Company by way of cheque or demand draft or transfer through electronic medium in favour of ICRA Limited. All Fees as mentioned herein shall not be refundable under any circumstances. ICRA reserves the right to revise the Surveillance Fee payable by you under this Agreement subject to maximum of 0.05% of the Security.</span></li>
      </ol>
      <p class="c1 c17"><span class="c2"></span></p>
      <ol class="c5 lst-kix_list_23-0" start="4">
         <li class="c8 c19 li-bullet-0"><span class="c20">Invoicing and contact details: Your Company shall provide the following details along with copy of PAN and TAN with ICRA for the purpose of invoicing: </span></li>
      </ol>
      <ol class="c5 lst-kix_list_35-0 start" start="1">
         <li class="c8 c39 c54 li-bullet-1"><span class="c2">Billing Contact Name: {!Opportunity.Contact_for_MPRA_SOW__r.Name}</span></li>
         <li class="c9 c39 c54 li-bullet-1"><span class="c2">Designation: {!Opportunity.Contact_for_MPRA_SOW__r.Designation__C}</span></li>
         <li class="c9 c39 c54 li-bullet-1"><span class="c2">Department: {!Opportunity.Contact_for_MPRA_SOW__r.Department}</span></li>
         <li class="c8 c39 c54 li-bullet-1"><span class="c2">Mailing Address:  {!Opportunity.Contact_for_MPRA_SOW__r.MailingStreet+' , '+Opportunity.Contact_for_MPRA_SOW__r.MailingCity+' , '+Opportunity.Contact_for_MPRA_SOW__r.MailingState+' , '+Opportunity.Contact_for_MPRA_SOW__r.MailingPostalCode+' , '+Opportunity.Contact_for_MPRA_SOW__r.MailingCountry}&nbsp;</span></li>
         <li class="c9 c39 c54 li-bullet-1"><span class="c2">Telephone: {!Opportunity.Contact_for_MPRA_SOW__r.phone}</span></li>
         <li class="c9 c39 c54 li-bullet-1"><span class="c2">&nbsp;E-mail Address: {!Opportunity.Contact_for_MPRA_SOW__r.email} </span></li>
         <li class="c9 c39 c54 li-bullet-1"><span class="c2">Permanent Account No: {!Opportunity.Account.PAN_Number__c}. (</span><span class="c35 c44 c20 c23">Please share the copy of PAN</span><span class="c2">) </span></li>
         <li class="c9 c39 c54 li-bullet-1"><span class="c2">Tax Deduction Account Number: {!Opportunity.Account.TAN_Number__c}. (</span><span class="c35 c44 c20 c23">Please share the copy of TAN</span><span class="c2">)</span></li>
      </ol>
      <p class="c1 c54"><span class="c13"></span></p>
      <p class="c9 c17"><span class="c51 c20">Invoice Instructions</span><span class="c20">: The locations of supplier of services and recipient of services for this Agreement under GST are as below:</span></p>
      <p class="c1 c54"><span class="c2"></span></p>
      <a id="t.5cac64430738ca3d1847f8eddf3ace67996f2e09"></a><a id="t.0"></a>
