      <ol class="c5 lst-kix_list_4-0 start" start="1">
         <li class="c8 c19 li-bullet-5"><span class="c2">This Agreement shall remain valid till the earlier of the date that the Rating assigned is withdrawn or the date that there are no longer any amounts outstanding against the PTC. This Agreement cannot be terminated by your Company once it has accepted or used the Rating.</span></li>
      </ol>
      <p class="c1 c17"><span class="c2"></span></p>
      <ol class="c5 lst-kix_list_4-0" start="2">
         <li class="c8 c19 li-bullet-6"><span class="c20">Notwithstanding clause E (I) above, the provisions of clauses K (</span><span class="c20 c23">Warranty</span><span class="c20">), L (</span><span class="c20 c23">Confidentiality</span><span class="c20">), M (</span><span class="c20 c23">Applicant Confidentiality</span><span class="c18 c23">&nbsp;</span><span class="c20 c23">for Unpublished ratings</span><span class="c20">), N (</span><span class="c20 c23">Indemnification</span><span class="c20">), O (</span><span class="c20 c23">Limitation of Liability</span><span class="c20">), P (</span><span class="c20 c23">Warranties with respect to information provided to ICRA</span><span class="c20">), Q (</span><span class="c20 c23">Use of information</span><span class="c2">) and T (IV) shall survive any termination of the Agreement.</span></li>
