      </ol>
      <p class="c1"><span class="c13"></span></p>
      <ol class="c5 lst-kix_list_15-0 start" start="1">
         <li class="c8 c19 li-bullet-7"><span class="c2">Subject to the terms and conditions of this Agreement, ICRA will keep the accepted Rating under surveillance until the earlier of the date that the Rating is withdrawn, in accordance with the provisions of the Regulations or the date that there are no longer any amounts outstanding against the PTCs. Following surveillance, ICRA may reaffirm, upgrade, downgrade, or withdraw the Rating (to the extent permitted by the Regulations); further, it may assign an outlook, or change or withdraw the outlook previously assigned; it may also place the Rating (previously assigned) on rating watch (with or without specified implications) or remove it from rating watch. </span></li>
      </ol>
      <p class="c1"><span class="c2"></span></p>
      <ol class="c5 lst-kix_list_15-0" start="2">
         <li class="c8 c19 li-bullet-7"><span class="c2">At any stage, failure on your part to furnish such information as ICRA may require from time to time, or failure to properly answer queries in a timely manner that may be raised by ICRA or failure on your part to pay Surveillance Fee, will result in ICRA carrying out the Rating surveillance on the basis of best available information. In addition, to the extent permitted by the Regulations, such failure on your part could result in ICRA withdrawing or revising the Rating assigned and disclose the rating outcome (inclusive of any reiterated/updated or modified Rating) as a non-cooperation Rating as required under the Regulations and not under contractual obligations under this Agreement. Notwithstanding the foregoing, the provisions of Clauses C, E, F, I, J, K, L, M, N, O, P, Q, S and T hereof shall, continue to apply to the Company and the Rating &nbsp;in accordance with the terms hereof.</span></li>
      </ol>
      <p class="c1 c17"><span class="c2"></span></p>
      <ol class="c5 lst-kix_list_15-0" start="3">
         <li class="c8 c19 li-bullet-5"><span class="c2">At any point, if ICRA is of the opinion that the circumstances then prevailing justify change, or withdrawal of the Rating, to the extent permitted by the Regulations, or warrant that the Rating be maintained at the existing level, it shall have the right to take the appropriate rating action, and such a decision shall be final and binding on your Company.</span></li>
      </ol>
