      <ol class="c5 lst-kix_list_7-0 start" start="1">
         <li class="c8 c19 li-bullet-6"><span class="c2">ICRA shall communicate its rating decision in terms of assignment or change (inclusive of any suspension or withdrawal, to the extent permitted by the Regulations) in the Rating to you in writing, and contemporaneously therewith, such initial Rating or change (in each case, inclusive of the rationale therefor, outlook and such other relevant information) shall be published in a press release in accordance with the Regulations. ICRA shall disclose both the ratings i.e. unsupported ratings without factoring in the explicit credit enhancement and supported rating after factoring in the explicit credit enhancement, as applicable, in the press release. In case either of the ratings is not accepted, both ratings shall be considered as unaccepted by the Company.</span></li>
