      <ol class="c5 lst-kix_list_8-0 start" start="1">
         <li class="c8 c19 li-bullet-6"><span class="c2">Your Company agrees to provide (or cause to be provided to ICRA) all information and clarifications relevant for the purposes of assigning and, on an ongoing basis, for the purposes of monitoring, the Rating(s) requested under this Agreement and to provide the information sought by ICRA immediately, but (subject to sub-clause III below) not later than 7 (seven) days from the date of seeking such information by ICRA. .</span></li>
