      <ol class="c5 lst-kix_list_8-0" start="2">
         <li class="c8 c19 li-bullet-6"><span class="c2">Your Company shall disclose to ICRA in writing all details relating to any default and/or delay in meeting debt obligations in the past. Additionally, your Company shall immediately disclose to ICRA in writing, all pertinent details relating to any default or delay which may occur in future in meeting debt obligations. You&nbsp;hereby consent that ICRA&nbsp;shall obtain the details related to existing and/or future borrowing of any nature, its repayment and delay or default, if any, of any nature, in servicing of the borrowing, either from the lender or any other statutory/non-statutory organization maintaining any such information to enable ICRA&nbsp;to have timely information on the same and to consider the impact of such information on the rating assigned by&nbsp;ICRA.</span></li>
