         <li class="c8 c19 li-bullet-5"><span class="c20">to inform ICRA immediately: (i) about </span><span class="c20 c47">any change in the terms and conditions or size of the Security before the issue of such Security; (ii) as and when the borrowing limit, as prescribed by the regulatory authority (ies), is exceeded for the Security ; (iii) </span><span class="c20">about any default or delay in payment of interest and/or principal against any debt instruments or borrowings of your Company; (iv)</span><span class="c20 c47">&nbsp;</span><span class="c20">of any other developments that may have a direct or indirect impact on the debt servicing capability of your Company. Such developments will include, </span><span class="c20 c23">inter alia</span><span class="c20">, significant expansion plans, change in business plans and/or any proposal for re-schedulement or postponement of the repayment programmes of the dues/debts of your Company; and (v) of any use of the Rating, following your non-acceptance of the Rating or failure to notify your acceptance/non-acceptance of the Rating to ICRA;</span></li>
