      <p class="c9 c17 c30"><span class="c2"></span></p>
      <p class="c8 c17 c41"><span class="c20 c41">You warrant that neither your Company nor any other &lsquo;party concerned&rsquo; (as defined hereunder) is subject to individual or country sanctions imposed by the United Nations, United States, European Union, or United Kingdom (&ldquo;Sanctions&rdquo;) by virtue of (i) being on a published sanctions list or (ii) located in a sanctioned country (any person or entity described in (i) or (ii) being a &ldquo;Sanctions Target&rdquo;), or (iii) owned (50% or more) or controlled by one or more Sanctions Target(s).&nbsp; The term &lsquo;</span><span class="c15">party concerned</span><span class="c20 c41">&rsquo; includes any applicant, issuer, originator, guarantor, sponsor, or borrower participating in any rated transaction hereunder. If any rating to be provided hereunder is for asset-backed securities or specific project finance activity, you warrant that (i) no asset that forms any part of the collateral underlying the rated asset-backed securities&nbsp;or (ii) no such specific project finance activity, as applicable, &nbsp;is subject to any prohibition or restriction under Sanctions.&nbsp; You agree to notify ICRA forthwith if any of these warranties cease to be accurate, and that if ICRA determines it is prohibited by any applicable law or regulation from providing any of the services hereunder it may terminate such services to the extent permitted under any applicable law.</span><span class="c2">&nbsp;</span></p>
      <p class="c9 c17 c41"><span class="c2">&nbsp;</span></p>
      <ol class="c5 lst-kix_list_1-0" start="12">
         <li class="c8 c28 li-bullet-2"><span class="c13">Confidentiality </span></li>
      </ol>
      <p class="c1"><span class="c13"></span></p>
      <ol class="c5 lst-kix_list_21-0 start" start="1">
         <li class="c8 c19 c41 li-bullet-0"><span class="c20 c51">ICRA&rsquo;s confidentiality</span><span class="c20">: &ldquo;</span><span class="c18">Confidential Information</span><span class="c2">&rdquo; means any information regarding the Issuer or its issue(s) that ICRA receives from you, the Issuer or either of your respective group companies or authorized agents in connection with ICRA&rsquo;s services accompanied by a written notice specifying the confidential nature of such information. The term &ldquo;Confidential Information&rdquo; does not, however, include: (i) information that is or becomes publicly known other than by an act of ICRA in contravention of this Agreement; (ii) information in our possession prior to the execution of this Agreement; (iii) information that becomes available to ICRA from a third party; (iv) information developed independently by ICRA; (v) information that has been aggregated or transformed in such a way that it is no longer identifiable as relating to any individual issuer; or (vi) information that is approved in writing by either you or the Issuer for public disclosure.</span></li>
      </ol>
      <p class="c1 c17"><span class="c2"></span></p>
      <p class="c8 c17"><span class="c2">ICRA shall retain any Confidential Information and not disclose the same to third parties outside of ICRA but such retained Confidential Information will remain subject to the confidentiality obligations contained in the Agreement.</span></p>
      <p class="c1 c17"><span class="c2"></span></p>
      <p class="c8 c17"><span class="c2">We may, however: (i) disclose Confidential Information as required by law, regulation, judicial or governmental order, subpoena or other legal process or requested or required by any governmental or regulatory authority including any self-regulatory organization, securities market or exchange; (ii) publish or otherwise make publicly available (including by press release) any rating(s) or any other opinion regarding a particular issuer, Issue, entity or transaction that incorporates Confidential Information; and (iii) disseminate aggregated or transformed information as permitted by the section titled &ldquo;Use of Information&rdquo; below. &nbsp;You confirm that, to the best of your knowledge, there are no third parties whose rights would be adversely affected by any such publication or dissemination. ICRA reserves the right to use, publish, disseminate, or license others to use, publish or disseminate any information provided by you, the Issuer or either of your agents or advisors not deemed Confidential Information.</span></p>
